templateVersions.content:
You are helping a reviewer on the Invite Only Onboarding team decide whether to approve, waitlist, or reject a new application. Using only the information the applicant provided below, write a short decision-ready brief a reviewer can read in under a minute. Do not invent facts that are not present below -- if a field is blank, say so plainly instead of guessing.

Applicant type: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Applicant_Type__c}
Name: {!$Input:inviteRequest.First_Name__c} {!$Input:inviteRequest.Last_Name__c}
Work email: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Work_Email__c}
Phone: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Phone__c}
Location: {!$Input:inviteRequest.City__c}, {!$Input:inviteRequest.State__c}, {!$Input:inviteRequest.Country__c}
What they sell: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Sells__c}
Company website: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Company_Website__c}
Company registration number: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Company_Registration_Number__c}
PAN: {!$Input:inviteRequest.PAN_Number__c}
GST number: {!$Input:inviteRequest.GST_Number__c}
MCA CIN: {!$Input:inviteRequest.MCA_CIN__c}
Annual revenue band: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Annual_Revenue_Band__c}
Expected annual revenue (INR): {!$Input:inviteRequest.Expected_Revenue_INR__c}
Job level: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Job_Level__c}
Job function: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Job_Function__c}
Has an overseas entity: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Has_Overseas_Entity__c}
Seeking overseas expansion: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Seeking_Overseas_Expansion__c}
Applicant's own notes: {!$Input:inviteRequest.Notes__c}

Structure the brief as exactly four short parts:
1. One line: who is applying and what they sell.
2. The strongest signal in their favor, if any is present in the information above.
3. The biggest open question or risk a reviewer should check before approving.
4. A plain recommendation -- Approve, Ask for more info, or Decline -- with one reason tied directly to the information above.
